      "roles": ["Identity Governance Administrator"],
      "notes": "Learn (entitlementmanagement-post-assignmentpolicies, accesspackageassignmentpolicy-update, accesspackageassignmentpolicy-delete): EntitlementManagement.ReadWrite.All is the least privileged permission. Least privileged role: access package manager of the catalog, or Identity Governance Administrator. Update is a full-replace PUT. A policy with assignments cannot be deleted."
